  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/T4xFVm8kct\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/964608/description_88829ca5-d813-4ded-b021-30cf3a70da2c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"365\" height=\"104\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fatii1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/964608/description_5d0091c0-57d5-4bc5-8592-ca850b88254c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"359\" height=\"102\"></a><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308486/description_9a094285-8843-43a7-91fd-7131c5d03d7f.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"60\"><br>该模组完全替换并革新了Minecraft中的村庄，将其改造成了基于中世纪建筑的繁华城镇与城市。<em>全部仅使用原版特性建造，意味着</em><em>不包含任何自定义方块或实体。</em><strong><br>（随意将其添加到任何整合包中）&nbsp;<br><br>建议配合以下模组以减少卡顿：</strong><br>Enhanced Block Entities<br>ImmediatelyFast<br>Sodium<br>Entity Culling<br>FerriteCore<br>Chunky</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308486/description_a175c332-b1a6-4770-a551-0d55892bfc78.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"60\"></p><p><strong>近期更新：</strong><br>支持1.21.11版本&nbsp;<br>优化了生成机制&nbsp;<br>兼容其他向村庄添加结构的模组<br><br>🆕&nbsp;<strong>5种原版村庄已完成3种：</strong><br>✅ 平原村庄<br>✅ 针叶林村庄<br>✅ 雪地村庄<br>🟧 热带草原村庄<br>🟧 沙漠村庄</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308486/description_9c6b75dd-54e6-4c40-8254-c1b2562948e8.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"60\"></p><p>正在开发中的系列模组列表：</p><p>✅ 史诗村庄<br>✅ 史诗女巫小屋<br>✅ 史诗地牢<br>✅ 史诗冰屋&nbsp;<br>🟨 史诗丛林神庙</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308486/description_3af40383-8222-4dc8-9b26-ea8587d2054f.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"60\"></p><p><strong>- ✅ </strong>完全兼容<strong>几乎所有地形生成模组<br></strong><strong>- ✅&nbsp;</strong>完全兼容<strong>ChoiceTheorem's Overhauled Village</strong>（选择定理的翻新村庄）<br><strong>- ✅ </strong>完全兼容 <strong>Guard Villagers </strong>（守卫村民）<strong>&nbsp;</strong><br><strong>- ✅ </strong>完全兼容 <strong>Waystones </strong>（传送石碑）<strong><br></strong><br>- <strong>🚧 与其他村庄翻新模组同时使用可能引起冲突 </strong><br><br><br></p>",
